{"strings": [
  {"text":"AFT · HOLD 1","translation":"船尾 · 1 號貨艙","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/aft_bulkhead.js"},
  {"text":"SEALED","translation":"已封存","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/aft_bulkhead.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2","translation":"2 號氣閘","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"LOCKED","translation":"已鎖定","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"STUCK","translation":"卡住","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"PARTLY OPEN","translation":"部分開啟","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"OPEN","translation":"開啟","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"MANUAL DRIVE","translation":"手動驅動","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"SUIT 02 · CH. 2","translation":"太空衣 02 · 頻道 2","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"COMMS","translation":"通訊","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"JAMMED","translation":"卡死","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AJAR","translation":"半開","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"LIDA · CORRIDOR 2-4","translation":"莉達 · 走廊 2-4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2: {state}","translation":"2 號氣閘：{state}","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CREW ON BOARD: 3/3","translation":"船上人員：3/3","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: VOICE","translation":"頻道 2：語音","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: NOISE","translation":"頻道 2：雜訊","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2  →","translation":"2 號氣閘  →","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"DECK 2 · SECT. 4","translation":"2 號甲板 · 第 4 區","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"CHECK PRESSURE BEFORE EXIT","translation":"出艙前請檢查氣壓","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"←  AIRLOCK 2","translation":"←  2 號氣閘","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"OBSERVATION BAY · 4","translation":"觀測艙 · 4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"O₂ · EMERG. MASKS","translation":"O₂ · 緊急面罩","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"Corridor by the Observation Bay","translation":"觀測艙旁的走廊","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"The Ladoga, deck 2. Emergency lighting, frost on the gratings, the airlock jammed.","translation":"拉多加號，2 號甲板。緊急照明，格柵上結了霜，氣閘卡死了。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have opened all the way. Cold drifts out of the chamber, vapour creeps across the floor.","translation":"2 號氣閘的艙門完全打開了。冷氣從艙室裡飄出來，蒸氣在地板上蔓延。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have parted a hand's width and stuck.","translation":"2 號氣閘的艙門打開了一個手掌寬，就卡住了。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Airlock 2 has closed and locked.","translation":"2 號氣閘關上並鎖定了。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has reached the airlock and taken hold of the manual drive's handle.","translation":"薇拉走到氣閘前，握住了手動驅動的把手。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has stopped at a porthole; beyond the glass, the red disc of the dwarf.","translation":"薇拉在一扇舷窗前停下；玻璃外，是紅矮星暗紅的圓盤。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has gone back to the observation bay hatch.","translation":"薇拉回到了觀測艙的艙口。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has disappeared into the airlock.","translation":"薇拉消失在氣閘裡。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"A trail of frost footprints from the airlock has reached the observation bay hatch.","translation":"一串結霜的腳印從氣閘一路延伸到觀測艙的艙口。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Ten percent of the oxygen is left in the corridor.","translation":"走廊裡的氧氣只剩百分之十。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The speaker by the airlock has come alive: hiss on the channel of suit 2, as if someone is holding down the talk button.","translation":"氣閘旁的喇叭響了起來：2 號太空衣的頻道傳來嘶嘶聲，好像有人一直按著通話鍵。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"}
]}
